Value CPU_5_SEC (\d+)
Value CPU_1_MIN (\d+)
Value CPU_5_MIN (\d+)
Value SLOT (\d+)
Value CPU_ID (\d+)

Start
  # Slot 0 CPU 0 CPU usage:
  ^Slot\s+${SLOT}\s+CPU\s+${CPU_ID}\s+CPU\s+usage
  # 5 seconds: 12%  1 minute: 10%  5 minutes: 8%
  ^\s*${CPU_5_SEC}%\s+in\s+last\s+5\s+seconds
  ^\s*${CPU_1_MIN}%\s+in\s+last\s+1\s+minute
  ^\s*${CPU_5_MIN}%\s+in\s+last\s+5\s+minutes -> Record
  # Summary table format: Slot CPU  Last 5 sec  Last 1 min  Last 5 min
  ^\s*${SLOT}\s+${CPU_ID}\s+${CPU_5_SEC}%\s+${CPU_1_MIN}%\s+${CPU_5_MIN}%\s*$$ -> Record
  # 兼容老格式: 5 seconds: 12%  1 minute: 10%  5 minutes: 8%
  ^\s*5\s+seconds:\s+${CPU_5_SEC}%\s+1\s+minute:\s+${CPU_1_MIN}%\s+5\s+minutes:\s+${CPU_5_MIN}% -> Record

